# fifo_child_page_list_full: A page list with no 0 in its 4096 entries: the scan stops at 4096, here every entry naming the same page, a 64 MiB ring. With a memory map (map, isolate) it maps and runs. In the blocks setup the root task's 16 MiB range allocator cannot place it (DeviceCore::new_range_mapping): the define still signals, and the FIFO never runs. Deleting it works in both.
